-- ===================================================================
-- THE LONG ROAD AHEAD - KINGDOM COME STYLE ANIMATED EXPEDITION MAP UI
-- Fast travel simulation map screen with Wearable Devices auto-centering,
-- mathematical dead-center player anchoring, continuous Zone background map,
-- simultaneous multi-level cartography loading, road-biased waypoint path traversal,
-- real-time vitals, accelerated world clock, ambient roadside reconnaissance logs,
-- and interactive ALife radar.
-- ===================================================================

